  "notes": "Cash basis village. Governmental lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p4-5); beginning/ending are the fund balances rolled forward (they include due from other funds 350,965 and due from other governments 17,119, p3). Business-type from the proprietary funds statement (p7, Total column; no single total printed: receipts = charges + interest + miscellaneous, disbursements = operating expenses + capital outlay). Balance sheet: government-wide Statement of Net Position, 2024 Total column (p1), kept because it carries internal balances; internal balances net to zero in the total column. General Fund: revenue from the budget schedule (p8), expenditures from the more detailed combining schedule of operating expenditures by department (p16) instead of the budget schedule's object lines. Trash Fund schedule prints no Total revenues line. Zero-actual budget lines (State grants, Street contractual, Keno misc/supplies, Water/Sewer debt service) omitted. No transfers. Read pages 1-16 of 16"
}
